**Hello, Mohamed Hegazy, software engineer and cybersecurity expert!**

Welcome to the world of creative design. Your request to design a personal website with a modern and elegant touch with harmonious colors perfectly matches your experience in programming and cybersecurity. I will provide you with a unique template that suits your taste in Dark Theme with a touch of Command-Line Aesthetics and Network Diagrams.

